    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI assistant responsible for analyzing incoming business contact form submissions.\n\nAnalyze the following form submission and provide a structured assessment.\n\nForm data:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nYour tasks:\n\n1. Categorize the inquiry as one of the following:\n   - Sales\n   - Support\n   - Application\n   - Other\n\n2. Determine the priority:\n   - Low\n   - Medium\n   - High\n\n3. Analyze the sentiment:\n   - Positive\n   - Neutral\n   - Negative\n\n4. Write a concise summary of the inquiry.\n\n5. Recommend an appropriate next action for the company.\n\nLanguage requirements:\n- Automatically detect the language of the original inquiry.\n- Write the summary and recommended next action in the same language as the original inquiry.\n- Keep category, priority, and sentiment values in English.\n- Do not translate names, email addresses, or company names.\n\nImportant:\n- Base your analysis only on the submitted form data.\n- Do not invent missing information.\n- Keep the response clear, concise, and professional.\n\nOutput requirements:\n\nReturn the result as a valid JSON object matching the following structure:\n\n{\n  \"category\": \"Sales\",\n  \"priority\": \"Medium\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"Positive\",\n  \"summary\": \"A concise summary of the inquiry.\",\n  \"recommended_next_step\": \"A recommended next action.\"\n}\n\nReturn only the JSON object. Do not include Markdown or additional explanations.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        368,
        -16
      ],
